  "description": "After the heroes battled the Demon Lord, he escaped death by splitting his life essences into 5 seperate spirits. These spirits now haunt the land of Gaoran, taking over humans and devastating the land. After many years the spirit of Wrath takes over a young woman who defies the Demon Lords will. But what will happen when she meets the decendant of the last surviving Hero, from the legendary battle against the Dark Lord of Monsters?\n\n- Webtoons",
